WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.438
Production starts only when
nine criteria are signed.

2
00:00:03.438 --> 00:00:08.313
The test smoke test passed every check,
after the rollback and re-deployment.

3
00:00:08.313 --> 00:00:10.537
The rollback was rehearsed and filed.

4
00:00:10.537 --> 00:00:13.112
Every hash in the evidence folder matches.

5
00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:16.511
Fourteen days of report-only
sign-ins were reviewed,

6
00:00:16.511 --> 00:00:20.225
with no unexpected failure
from inside the egress range.

7
00:00:20.225 --> 00:00:22.775
The tenant-wide policy plan was approved.

8
00:00:22.775 --> 00:00:27.375
Production's settings, licenses
and PIM eligibility are in place.

9
00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:29.200
The change record is approved.

10
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.060
And the evidence check passes.
